OL,3,GNEWSABonfire Night violence condemned
OL,4,Aas six arrested
OL,5,
OL,6,FCh Supt Daniel Whyte said anyone else
OL,7,Finvolved in the disorder should expect
OL,8,Fa "knock on the door". Ian Miller, who
OL,9,Fruns the local community centre The
OL,10,FMeadows, said people had a right to
OL,11,Ffeel safe where they live.
